Package: naxlo-two
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, desktop-file-utils
Recommends: libnss3
Suggests: xray-core | sing-box
Description: Proxy client for Xray-core and sing-box
 Naxlo Two configures and supervises Xray-core (or sing-box) as a child
 process: local SOCKS5/HTTP inbounds, optional system-proxy takeover,
 per-profile routing and DNS, and a ranker that scores servers on latency,
 jitter, reliability and throughput instead of ping alone.
 .
 No telemetry: profiles, samples and logs stay in the user's app-support
 directory.
